212
00:16:57,610 --> 00:16:58,800
<font face="Segoe UI" size="55"><i>Thôi, bỏ đi.</i></font>

213
00:17:01,210 --> 00:17:02,840
<font face="Segoe UI" size="55"><i>Saito, cậu sẵn sàng chưa?</i></font>

214
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:04,580
<font face="Segoe UI" size="55"><i>Tôi đã sẵn sàng.</i></font>

215
00:17:04,580 --> 00:17:05,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="55"><i>Tốt.</i></font>

216
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:22,330
<font face="Segoe UI" size="55">Xem ra chúng sẽ tấn công bừa bãi
